AWS Bedrock → Accessing 3rd-party LLM models from one place

Simple explanation

AWS Bedrock allows you to access different Large Language Models (LLMs) from a single AWS platform.

AWS Bedrock
     │
     ├── LLM Model 1
     ├── LLM Model 2
     ├── LLM Model 3
     └── LLM Model 4

====

AWS Bedrock = One place to access multiple third-party AI/LLM models.

AWS Bedrock provides access to multiple third-party LLMs in one place, while JumpStart starts with a pretrained model for customization, so 
the key difference is model access versus model adaptation.

=====
